8444988727569], [[[860.0, 790.0], [1506.0, 790.0], [1506.0, 819.0], [860.0, 819.0]], "1.【原句译文】近年来，越来越多的城市居民为农村的", 0.8870895596650931], [[[222.0, 828.0], [797.0, 828.0], [797.0, 854.0], [222.0, 854.0]], "第段：向俱乐部成员说明自已想推荐哪本书，", 0.8985436104592823], [[[889.0, 836.0], [1509.0, 837.0], [1509.0, 866.0], [889.0, 865.0]], "田园风光所吸引利用节假日到乡村旅游。Inrecent", 0.9218533326078344], [[[164.0, 876.0], [476.0, 875.0], [476.0, 902.0], [164.0, 903.0]], "并指出该书的作者和体裁。", 0.8851698407760034], [[[886.0, 890.0], [1507.0, 886.0], [1507.0, 913.0], [886.0, 917.0]], "years, an increasing number of urban residents have", 0.9451942352148203], [[[221.0, 922.0], [815.0, 922.0], [815.0, 951.0], [221.0, 951.0]], "第二段：简单介绍该书的内容并具体阐述推荐该", 0.930466050451452], [[[884.0, 934.0], [1507.0, 934.0], [1507.0, 963.0], [884.0, 963.0]], "been attracted by the rural idyllic scene and have taken", 0.9167247676012809], [[[163.0, 970.0], [287.0, 970.0], [287.0, 1000.0], [163.0, 1000.0]], "书的理由。", 0.7740115722020467], [[[887.0, 983.0], [1479.0, 982.0], [1479.0, 1009.0], [887.0, 1010.0]], "advantage of their holidays to travel to the countryside.", 0.9059372698438579], [[[221.0, 1017.0], [589.0, 1017.0], [589.0, 1046.0], [221.0, 1046.0]], "第三段：总结全文，表达期望。", 0.8862669547398885], [[[889.0, 1027.0], [1507.0, 1027.0], [1507.0, 1056.0], [889.0, 1056.0]], "【句子分析】本句描述乡村旅游受到越来越多城市", 0.8989328690197157], [[[163.0, 1065.0], [315.0, 1065.0], [315.0, 1095.0], [163.0, 1095.0]], "【参考范文】", 0.8398082171167646], [[[889.0, 1076.0], [1506.0, 1076.0], [1506.0, 1102.0], [889.0, 1102.0]], "居民的喜爱这一现象，且结合时间标志词*近年", 0.8634312450885773], [[[221.0, 1115.0], [815.0, 1116.0], [815.0, 1143.0], [221.0, 1142.0]], "When it comes to the books I've read recently, it", 0.8709134173393249], [[[888.0, 1121.0], [1492.0, 1121.0], [1492.0, 1150.0], [888.0, 1150.0]], "来”可知，译文时态应采用现在完成时。分析可知，", 0.9064227367440859], [[[165.0, 1165.0], [815.0, 1165.0], [815.0, 1192.0], [165.0, 1192.0]], "will be the book Oliver Twisi, a realistic novel by Charles", 0.887274980545044], [[[887.0, 1170.0], [1507.0, 1170.0], [1507.0, 1199.0], [887.0, 1199.0]], "第一个逗号后的内容可处理为主干句，其中“越来", 0.8911383255668308], [[[164.0, 1212.0], [773.0, 1212.0], [773.0, 1241.0], [164.0, 1241.0]], "Dickens, that I highly recommend to all of you this time.", 0.9444825823964744], [[[887.0, 1218.0], [1507.0, 1218.0], [1507.0, 1247.0], [887.0, 1247.0]], "越多的城市居民”可处理为主语，第二个逗号前后", 0.9113434190335481], [[[219.0, 1258.0], [815.0, 1260.0], [815.0, 1290.0], [219.0, 1288.0]], "Set in London, the book tells the story of an orphan", 0.9228229713889787], [[[888.0, 1265.0], [1506.0, 1265.0], [1506.0, 1294.0], [888.0, 1294.0]], "的“为农村的田园风光所吸引”和“利用节假日", 0.9055686376311562], [[[163.0, 1306.0], [815.0, 1308.0], [815.0, 1338.0], [163.0, 1336.0]], "boy named Oliver Twist, who endured immense hardship", 0.9226031235928805], [[[887.0, 1313.0], [1507.0, 1313.0], [1507.0, 1342.0], [887.0, 1342.0]], "到乡村旅游”可处理为and连接的并列成分。具体", 0.9264441902438799], [[[162.0, 1354.0], [817.0, 1354.0], [817.0, 1387.0], [162.0, 1387.0]], "and fortunately found his relatives and led a happy life", 0.9236331435672024], [[[888.0, 1360.0], [1510.0, 1360.0], [1510.0, 1390.0], [888.0, 1390.0]], "翻译时，“近年来”可处理为介词短语\"Inrecent", 0.8531377801188716], [[[163.0, 1403.0], [813.0, 1403.0], [813.0, 1433.0], [163.0, 1433.0]], "eventually. The reasons for my recommendation are chiefly", 0.9433001958090683], [[[883.0, 1404.0], [1510.0, 1399.0], [1510.0, 1438.0], [883.0, 1443.0]], "years”，作时间状语置于句首，并用逗号将其与后", 0.9170945997421558], [[[162.0, 1450.0], [817.0, 1450.0], [817.0, 1479.0], [162.0, 1479.0]], "as follows. For one thing, this book helps broaden our", 0.9442345554178412], [[[889.0, 1457.0], [1507.0, 1457.0], [1507.0, 1483.0], [889.0, 1483.0]], "面的内容隔开：“越来越多的城市居民”可译为“an", 0.90231849193573], [[[162.0, 1499.0], [817.0, 1499.0], [817.0, 1528.0], [162.0, 1528.0]], "horizons, for Dickens successfully portrayed the characters", 0.9311330477396648], [[[885.0, 1504.0], [1508.0, 1502.0], [1508.0, 1532.0], [885.0, 1534.0]], "increasing numberof urban residents\"；“为-..-所吸", 0.8368093734202178], [[[163.0, 1547.0], [816.0, 1546.0], [816.0, 1576.0], [163.0, 1577.0]], "by skillful design, sharp words and the wonderful plot", 0.922668579491702], [[[887.0, 1549.0], [1510.0, 1549.0], [1510.0, 1582.0], [887.0, 1582.0]], "引可译为“have been attractedby.”；“农村的田园", 0.8620580807328224], [[[165.0, 1596.0], [816.0, 1596.0], [816.0, 1622.0], [165.0, 1622.0]], "which is full of twists and turns. For another, what Oliver", 0.8868825892607372], [[[887.0, 1596.0], [1507.0, 1595.0], [1507.0, 1628.0], [887.0, 1629.0]], "风光”可译为“therural idyllic scene\"；“利用节假日”", 0.8977087002534133], [[[158.0, 1638.0], [819.0, 1641.0], [818.0, 1677.0], [158.0, 1674.0]], "has experienced is a great inspiration to us. Growing up", 0.923426628112793], [[[161.0, 1691.0], [815.0, 1691.0], [815.0, 1720.0], [161.0, 1720.0]], "in an environment of violence, cruelty and prejudice, he", 0.9367418540151495], [[[891.0, 1692.0], [1490.0, 1692.0], [1490.0, 1721.0], [891.0, 1721.0]], "乡村旅游”可处理为动词不定式短语，作目的状语，", 0.9074162443478903], [[[161.0, 1738.0], [816.0, 1737.0], [816.0, 1767.0], [161.0, 1768.0]], "suffered years of physical and mental torment, but with", 0.9379568153194019], [[[887.0, 1740.0], [1301.0, 1740.0], [1301.0, 1770.0], [887.0, 1770.0]], "译为“\"to travelto the countryside”。", 0.8639387295526617], [[[162.0, 1785.0], [817.0, 1784.0], [817.0, 1814.0], [162.0, 1815.0]], "his indomitable nature, he conguered the unbelievable", 0.9234730352958044], [[[856.0, 1785.0], [1507.0, 1786.0], [1507.0, 1816.0], [856.0, 1815.0]], "2.「原句译文】他们住在农民家中，品尝具有当地风味", 0.8861164049460337], [[[164.0, 1834.0], [814.0, 1834.0], [814.0, 1863.0], [164.0, 1863.0]], "misery. Therefore, no matter how difficult our lives may be,", 0.9165230520436021], [[[887.0, 1834.0], [1509.0, 1836.0], [1509.0, 1866.0], [887.0, 1864.0]], "的农家饭菜。They live in the farmers houses and taste", 0.9029753028104702], [[[163.0, 1881.0], [814.0, 1883.0], [814.0, 1913.0], [163.0, 1911.0]], "we shouldn't lose hope, kindness, courage and integrity", 0.9090258974049773], [[[886.0, 1885.0], [1154.0, 1883.0], [1154.0, 1910.0], [886.0, 1913.0]], "cuisine with local flavor.", 0.8824808818322641], [[[163.0, 1930.0], [815.0, 1930.0], [815.0, 1961.0], [163.0, 1961.0]], "as those are the motivation that keeps us moving forward.", 0.9486529426328068], [[[888.0, 1928.0], [1507.0, 1929.0], [1507.0, 1960.0], [888.0, 1958.0]], "【句子分析】本句描述城市游客在乡村旅游时会进", 0.9229775693105615], [[[164.0, 1977.0], [535.0, 1977.0], [535.0, 2010.0], [164.0, 2010.0]], "Oliver is just the shining example.", 0.902336158686214], [[[888.0, 1978.0], [1505.0, 1978.0], [1505.0, 2007.0], [888.0, 2007.0]], "行的活动，故译文时态应采用一般现在时。分析可知，", 0.922547926902771], [[[217.0, 2022.0], [819.0, 2023.0], [819.0, 2059.0], [217.0, 2058.0]], "This book brings me a deeper insight into good and", 0.9163480447787865], [[[890.0, 2025.0], [1508.0, 2025.0], [1508.0, 2054.0], [890.0, 2054.0]], "可将“他们”处理为主语，并将“住在农民家中”和", 0.8498039816816648], [[[164.0, 2073.0], [814.0, 2073.0], [814.0, 2103.0], [164.0, 2103.0]], "evil, beauty and ugliness. It deserves high praise and I hope", 0.9194709581713523], [[[900.0, 2071.0], [1508.0, 2071.0], [1508.0, 2104.0], [900.0, 2104.0]], "“品尝具有当地风味的农家饭菜”处理为and连接", 0.9236497183640798], [[[163.0, 2123.0], [485.0, 2122.0], [485.0, 2149.0], [163.0, 2150.0]], "it will be to your taste as well.", 0.8998416855054743], [[[888.0, 2120.0], [1507.0, 2120.0], [1507.0, 2150.0], [888.0, 2150.0]], "的并列成分。其体翻译时，“他们”可译为“They\"；“住", 0.8349600752879833], [[[1469.0, 2166.0], [1509.0, 2163.0], [1512.0, 2197.0], [1472.0, 2201.0]], "33", 0.5221415360768636]]}, {"width": 1653, "lines": [[[[177.0, 155.0], [800.0, 158.0], [800.0, 188.0], [177.0, 185.0]], "在农民家中”可译为“live in thefarmershouses”；", 0.8918100418271245], [[[871.0, 158.0], [1489.0, 160.0], [1489.0, 186.0], [871.0, 184.0]], "发展 In fact, this form of tourism can not only benefit", 0.8265529694380583], [[[870.0, 209.0], [1491.0, 209.0], [1491.0, 235.0], [870.0, 235.0]], "urban tourists, but